start: mr
R1: C1@{3ch=dc {2dc 3ch [3dc 3ch]x3}@ring ss@top}
R2: C1@{3ch=dc 2dc@same ch [{3dc 3ch 3dc}@same ch]x3 3dc@sp 3ch ss@top} # text says ch3 between corners, rep 3 times; drafted as a standard granny
R3: C1@{3ch=dc 2dc@same ch} C2@{3dc@sp ch} C1@{{3dc 3ch 3dc}@same ch 3dc@sp ch} C2@{{3dc 3ch 3dc}@same ch} C1@{3dc@sp ch} C2@{{3dc 3ch 3dc}@same ch} C1@{3dc@sp ch 3dc@sp 3ch ss@top} # C1 pink, C2 blue; "(3dc+2dc+ch3+3dc)" read as a corner
R4: C2@{3ch=dc {2dc 3ch 3dc}@same ch [3dc@sp ch]x2 [{3dc 3ch 3dc}@same ch [3dc@sp ch]x2]x3 ss@top}
